s, when given), described by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"generators, by the orbits they cut the vertices into, and by its order.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IsomorphismModule\/documentation\/IsomorphismModule\/AutomorphismGroup","url":"\/documentation\/isomorphismmodule\/automorphismgroup"}}}